  "notices": [
    "GitHub prerelease: https://github.com/Cork-Technology/phoenix/releases/tag/v1.4.0-rc.1. This record does not complete or approve the surrounding Distribution cut.",
    "Runtime equivalence and proxy bindings verified at finalized Base block 51171628 and Arbitrum block 504060971 against the public tagged commit production build: Solidity 0.8.30, optimizer runs 1, viaIR true, Paris EVM, no CBOR metadata. Runtime-affecting immutables and library links were resolved from source before whole-runtime comparison.",
    "ABIs are exported from compiler artifacts bound to the exact public tagged source and its pinned dependencies. Proxy ABI files describe ERC1967Proxy shells; application callers use the corresponding Implementation ABI.",
    "Null contract versions mean no supported component-version getter; EIP-712 domain versions and UPGRADE_INTERFACE_VERSION are not release versions.",
    "No historical constructor transaction, storage-only initialization, governance approval, activation, independent security review or production-support assurance is implied."
  ],
  "knownIssues": [
    "ABI-breaking relative to 1.3.0-rc.1 despite the 1.4 version label: expanded Market tuples and MarketCreated, removed fee-management functions and events. Regenerate bindings and update integrations.",
    "Contracts lack a component version() getter. Release identity is established by the public source tag and verified runtime, not a runtime version string.",
    "Publication does not establish independent review or complete the remaining Distribution integration and release-process gates."
  ],
